<h2>一、环境准备</h2>
<h3>1.1 安装 Docker Engine 27.0+</h3>
<p>Docker 27.0 版本带来了对 containerd 2.0 的原生支持和多架构构建增强。</p>
<p><strong>安装步骤（Ubuntu 22.04 LTS）</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%8D%B8%E8%BD%BD%E6%97%A7%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20remove%20docker%20docker-engine%20docker.io%20containerd%20runc%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E4%BE%9D%E8%B5%96%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20install%20ca-certificates%20curl%20gnupg%20lsb-release%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%20Docker%20%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%20GPG%20%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%5Cnsudo%20install%20-m%200755%20-d%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%5Cncurl%20-fsSL%20https%3A%2F%2Fdownload.docker.com%2Flinux%2Fubuntu%2Fgpg%20%7C%20sudo%20gpg%20--dearmor%20-o%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%2Fdocker.gpg%5Cnsudo%20chmod%20a%2Br%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%2Fdocker.gpg%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%A8%B3%E5%AE%9A%E7%89%88%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%5Cnecho%20%5C%22deb%20%5Barch%3D%24%28dpkg%20--print-architecture%29%20signed-by%3D%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%2Fdocker.gpg%5D%20https%3A%2F%2Fdownload.docker.com%2Flinux%2Fubuntu%20%24%28lsb_release%20-cs%29%20stable%5C%22%20%7C%20sudo%20tee%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fsources.list.d%2Fdocker.list%20%26gt%3B%20%2Fdev%2Fnull%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC%20Docker%20Engine%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20install%20docker-ce%20docker-ce-cli%20containerd.io%20docker-buildx-plugin%20docker-compose-plugin%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20docker%20--version%5Cn%23%20%E5%BA%94%E6%98%BE%E7%A4%BA%3A%20Docker%20Engine%20-%20Community%2027.0.x%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22bIlyj%22%7D"></card>
<p><strong>配置 Docker 以非 root 用户运行</strong>（安全最佳实践）：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20usermod%20-aG%20docker%20%24USER%5Cnnewgrp%20docker%5Cn%23%20%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAC4p%22%7D"></card>
<h3>1.2 部署 Kubernetes 1.30 集群</h3>
<p>使用 kubeadm 部署最新稳定版 K8s 1.30。</p>
<p><strong>前置条件检查</strong>：</p>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>检查项</td><td>要求</td><td>验证命令</td></tr>
<tr><td>操作系统</td><td>Ubuntu 22.04+</td><td><code>cat /etc/os-release</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>内存</td><td>≥ 4GB</td><td><code>free -h</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>CPU</td><td>≥ 2核</td><td><code>nproc</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>磁盘空间</td><td>≥ 50GB</td><td><code>df -h /</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Swap</td><td>已关闭</td><td><code>swapon --show</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>端口</td><td>6443, 2379-2380, 10250-10252 可用</td><td><code>netstat -tlnp</code></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>安装 containerd</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%20containerd%202.0%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20install%20containerd%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cnsudo%20mkdir%20-p%20%2Fetc%2Fcontainerd%5Cncontainerd%20config%20default%20%7C%20sudo%20tee%20%2Fetc%2Fcontainerd%2Fconfig.toml%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%20SystemdCgroup%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%5Cnsudo%20sed%20-i%20%27s%2FSystemdCgroup%20%5C%5C%3D%20false%2FSystemdCgroup%20%5C%5C%3D%20true%2Fg%27%20%2Fetc%2Fcontainerd%2Fconfig.toml%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%87%8D%E5%90%AF%20containerd%5Cnsudo%20systemctl%20restart%20containerd%5Cnsudo%20systemctl%20enable%20containerd%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22dFpfh%22%7D"></card>
<p><strong>安装 kubeadm, kubelet, kubectl</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%20swap%5Cnsudo%20swapoff%20-a%5Cnsudo%20sed%20-i%20%27%2Fswap%2Fs%2F%5E%2F%23%2F%27%20%2Fetc%2Ffstab%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%5Cnsudo%20modprobe%20overlay%5Cnsudo%20modprobe%20br_netfilter%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5Cncat%20%26lt%3B%26lt%3BEOF%20%7C%20sudo%20tee%20%2Fetc%2Fsysctl.d%2Fkubernetes.conf%5Cnnet.bridge.bridge-nf-call-iptables%20%3D%201%5Cnnet.bridge.bridge-nf-call-ip6tables%20%3D%201%5Cnnet.ipv4.ip_forward%20%3D%201%5CnEOF%5Cnsudo%20sysctl%20--system%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%20Kubernetes%20%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%5Cnecho%20%5C%22deb%20%5Bsigned-by%3D%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%2Fkubernetes-apt-keyring.gpg%5D%20https%3A%2F%2Fpkgs.k8s.io%2Fcore%3A%2Fstable%3A%2Fv1.30%2Fdeb%2F%20%2F%5C%22%20%7C%20sudo%20tee%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fsources.list.d%2Fkubernetes.list%5Cncurl%20-fsSL%20https%3A%2F%2Fpkgs.k8s.io%2Fcore%3A%2Fstable%3A%2Fv1.30%2Fdeb%2FRelease.key%20%7C%20sudo%20gpg%20--dearmor%20-o%20%2Fetc%2Fapt%2Fkeyrings%2Fkubernetes-apt-keyring.gpg%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20update%5Cnsudo%20apt-get%20install%20kubelet%20kubeadm%20kubectl%5Cnsudo%20apt-mark%20hold%20kubelet%20kubeadm%20kubectl%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22EhXCP%22%7D"></card>
<p><strong>初始化 Master 节点</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20kubeadm%20init%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--apiserver-advertise-address%3D10.0.0.10%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--pod-network-cidr%3D10.244.0.0%2F16%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--kubernetes-version%3Dv1.30.0%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%20kubectl%5Cnmkdir%20-p%20%24HOME%2F.kube%5Cnsudo%20cp%20-i%20%2Fetc%2Fkubernetes%2Fadmin.conf%20%24HOME%2F.kube%2Fconfig%5Cnsudo%20chown%20%24%28id%20-u%29%3A%24%28id%20-g%29%20%24HOME%2F.kube%2Fconfig%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%5Cnkubectl%20get%20nodes%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ss0CE%22%7D"></card>
<p><strong>加入 Worker 节点</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%20Worker%20%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%EF%BC%88token%20%E6%9D%A5%E8%87%AA%20init%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%89%5Cnsudo%20kubeadm%20join%2010.0.0.10%3A6443%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--token%20abcdef.0123456789abcdef%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--discovery-token-ca-cert-hash%20sha256%3Axxxxx%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22W6qpz%22%7D"></card>
