<h2>二、应用容器化</h2>
<h3>2.1 编写 Dockerfile</h3>
<p><strong>Spring Boot 应用 Dockerfile 示例</strong>：</p>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22dockerfile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%A4%9A%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B51%3A%20%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%5CnFROM%20maven%3A3.9-eclipse-temurin-17%20AS%20builder%5CnWORKDIR%20%2Fapp%5CnCOPY%20pom.xml%20.%5CnRUN%20mvn%20dependency%3Ago-offline%5CnCOPY%20src%20.%2Fsrc%5CnRUN%20mvn%20package%20-DskipTests%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B52%3A%20%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%5CnFROM%20eclipse-temurin%3A17-jre-alpine%5CnWORKDIR%20%2Fapp%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%5CnRUN%20apk%20add%20--no-cache%20curl%20tzdata%20%26amp%3B%26amp%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20cp%20%2Fusr%2Fshare%2Fzoneinfo%2FAsia%2FShanghai%20%2Fetc%2Flocaltime%20%26amp%3B%26amp%3B%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20echo%20%5C%22Asia%2FShanghai%5C%22%20%26gt%3B%20%2Fetc%2Ftimezone%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E4%BA%A7%E7%89%A9%5CnCOPY%20--from%3Dbuilder%20%2Fapp%2Ftarget%2F%2A.jar%20app.jar%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%5CnHEALTHCHECK%20--interval%3D30s%20--timeout%3D3s%20--retries%3D3%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20CMD%20curl%20-f%20http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A8080%2Factuator%2Fhealth%20%7C%7C%20exit%201%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%9A%B4%E9%9C%B2%E7%AB%AF%E5%8F%A3%5CnEXPOSE%208080%5Cn%5Cn%23%20JVM%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5CnENV%20JAVA_OPTS%3D%5C%22-Xms512m%20-Xmx512m%20-XX%3A%2BUseG1GC%20-XX%3AMaxGCPauseMillis%3D200%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%5CnENTRYPOINT%20%5B%5C%22sh%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22-c%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22java%20%24JAVA_OPTS%20-jar%20app.jar%5C%22%5D%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22J7tIB%22%7D"></card>
<h3>2.2 构建和推送镜像</h3>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%5Cndocker%20build%20-t%20registry.example.com%2Forder-service%3Av4.0.0%20.%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%A4%9A%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%EF%BC%88AMD64%20%2B%20ARM64%EF%BC%89%5Cndocker%20buildx%20build%20--platform%20linux%2Famd64%2Clinux%2Farm64%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20-t%20registry.example.com%2Forder-service%3Av4.0.0%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20--push%20.%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E7%A7%81%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%5Cndocker%20login%20registry.example.com%20-u%20admin%20-p%20%26lt%3Bpassword%26gt%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E9%95%9C%E5%83%8F%5Cndocker%20push%20registry.example.com%2Forder-service%3Av4.0.0%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%229MNQY%22%7D"></card>
<h3>2.3 镜像优化最佳实践</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>优化项</td><td>说明</td><td>效果</td></tr>
<tr><td>多阶段构建</td><td>分离构建环境和运行环境</td><td>镜像减小60%+</td></tr>
<tr><td>使用Alpine基础镜像</td><td>替代完整OS镜像</td><td>镜像减小80%</td></tr>
<tr><td>合并RUN指令</td><td>减少镜像层数</td><td>减少镜像大小</td></tr>
<tr><td>.dockerignore</td><td>排除不必要文件</td><td>加快构建速度</td></tr>
<tr><td>使用构建缓存</td><td>依赖先复制再复制源码</td><td>加快构建速度</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
