<h2>七、安全加固</h2>
<h3>7.1 容器安全</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>安全项</td><td>配置</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>非root用户运行</td><td><code>USER 1000:1000</code></td><td>避免root权限</td></tr>
<tr><td>只读文件系统</td><td><code>readOnlyRootFilesystem: true</code></td><td>防止恶意写入</td></tr>
<tr><td>禁用特权</td><td><code>privileged: false</code></td><td>最小权限原则</td></tr>
<tr><td>能力裁剪</td><td><code>drop: ["ALL"]</code></td><td>移除所有Linux能力</td></tr>
<tr><td>安全上下文</td><td><code>runAsNonRoot: true</code></td><td>强制非root</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>7.2 Pod Security Standards</h3>
<card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22yaml%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22apiVersion%3A%20v1%5Cnkind%3A%20Namespace%5Cnmetadata%3A%5Cn%20%20name%3A%20production%5Cn%20%20labels%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20pod-security.kubernetes.io%2Fenforce%3A%20restricted%5Cn%20%20%20%20pod-security.kubernetes.io%2Faudit%3A%20restricted%5Cn%20%20%20%20pod-security.kubernetes.io%2Fwarn%3A%20restricted%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%225eUv2%22%7D"></card>
<card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%225w8z4%22%7D"></card>
<h2>八、故障排查</h2>
<h3>8.1 常用排查命令</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>场景</td><td>命令</td><td>说明</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看Pod状态</td><td><code>kubectl get pods -n production</code></td><td>检查Pod运行状态</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看Pod详情</td><td><code>kubectl describe pod &lt;pod-name&gt; -n production</code></td><td>排查启动失败</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看容器日志</td><td><code>kubectl logs &lt;pod-name&gt; -n production</code></td><td>查看应用日志</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看上一容器日志</td><td><code>kubectl logs &lt;pod-name&gt; --previous -n production</code></td><td>崩溃前日志</td></tr>
<tr><td>进入容器</td><td><code>kubectl exec -it &lt;pod-name&gt; -- /bin/sh</code></td><td>容器内调试</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看事件</td><td><code>kubectl get events -n production --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'</code></td><td>排查调度问题</td></tr>
<tr><td>端口转发</td><td><code>kubectl port-forward &lt;pod-name&gt; 8080:8080</code></td><td>本地访问Pod</td></tr>
<tr><td>查看资源使用</td><td><code>kubectl top pods -n production</code></td><td>CPU/内存使用</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>8.2 常见问题</h3>
<table>
<colgroup><col width="266"><col width="266"><col width="266"></colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr><td>问题</td><td>可能原因</td><td>解决方案</td></tr>
<tr><td>ImagePullBackOff</td><td>镜像不存在/无权限</td><td>检查镜像名和Secret</td></tr>
<tr><td>CrashLoopBackOff</td><td>应用启动失败</td><td>查看日志，检查配置</td></tr>
<tr><td>OOMKilled</td><td>内存不足</td><td>调整resources.limits</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pending</td><td>资源不足/调度失败</td><td>检查节点资源，查看events</td></tr>
<tr><td>健康检查失败</td><td>应用未就绪</td><td>检查探针配置和应用状态</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<card type="block" name="hr" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%2262bKk%22%7D"></card>
